{"data": [{"author_id": "1196624181439283200", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:45:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119184603835728371"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/mtrainier2020/…", "end": 189, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/mtrainier2020/status/2119149146959647056", "start": 166, "url": "https://t.co/pEIuAXAJUE"}]}, "id": "2119184603835728371", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119149146959647056", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "昨天去Superstore买东西，回来我问儿子，Superstore和旁边的Shopper是不是父子公司呀。他说，不是，他们是兄弟公司，同样的公司还有很多，比如T&amp;T，他们都是Weston家族的企业。我说不可能，TT是台湾人开的。随即让Grok验证，他再次对了。这家伙学习压力已经这么大了，怎么还有时间研究这些？什么都看， https://t.co/pEIuAXAJUE", "url": "https://x.com/ThinkWithSophie/status/2119184603835728371"}, {"author_id": "22236944", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:18:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119177795053957251"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/vpLMs3Xs0x", "end": 183, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/dylanzhao/status/2119177795053957251/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119176965206724609", "start": 160, "url": "https://t.co/vpLMs3Xs0x"}]}, "id": "2119177795053957251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 755, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "马斯克的脑机接口公司Neuralink，第一个植入者是2024年1月的诺兰·阿博——由于跳水事故导致四肢瘫痪，他靠脑子里的芯片控制光标、打字、玩游戏。到2026年1月，已有21人植入。马斯克的路线图是电极通道数从现在的1024个，2026年到3000个，2027年1万个，2028年2.5万个以上，深入大脑更深的区域。 https://t.co/vpLMs3Xs0x", "url": "https://x.com/dylanzhao/status/2119177795053957251"}, {"author_id": "1947858537893310466", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:08:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119175253658100148"], "id": "2119175253658100148", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I might need a software upgrade for the BCI output….\n